# Interview notes: head of product, Harbor Analytics (14 March 2026)

Q: What changed in your pricing last year?
A: "We moved from per-seat to per-workspace pricing in the spring, and churn in the smallest tier fell."
Q: What is the biggest risk you see?
A: "Larger customers are asking for on-premises installs, which we do not offer."


